<title>MALAYSIA: Keck Seng 6-month net profit up 38 pct.</title>
<headline>Keck Seng 6-month net profit up 38 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		22.40	vs	16.24</p>
<p>    Shr     (cents)	  9.37	vs	10.22</p>
<p>    Turnover		 255.08	vs     226.26</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  31.55	vs	25.07</p>
<p>    Minorities     less    0.03	vs  less 0.03</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 19.49	vs	61.88</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	5.0	 vs	 6.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the company is Keck Seng (Malaysia) Bhd. It is mainly involved in the cultivation of oil palm and cocoa as well as related activities.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
